    "intro_narrative": "You awaken in the belly of the Airborne Leviathan, a colossal steam-powered airship rapidly losing altitude. The master chronometer has locked the main engine controls, and the air is thick with the smell of burning coal, hot oil, and the sharp hiss of escaping steam. Around you lies a complex network of brass contraptions, locked steel vaults, and pressure terminals interconnected by intricate copper piping. Your objective is to trace the flow of information through these mechanical marvels and restore the power sequence before the airship crashes. You must carefully navigate the gear-driven machines, using the correct outputs from one device to fuel the next, ultimately overriding the system.",
    "narrative_style": "steampunk"
  },
